# Phase 5 transcript (T-U6, fx v0.0.16's 9db199e4): an edit of a file whose
# other lines hold bytes a terminal could act on or draw as nothing
# (p5-transcript-diffws/bad.txt), read first on both sides, then Ctrl-O over
# the change: every diff row must show those bytes as visible escapes.
gateway p5-transcript-diffbad-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
work p5-transcript-diffws
keep
wait 4
type edit the file
wait 1
key Enter
wait 5
snap edited
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key C-o
wait 1
snap closed
workls end
gwlog
